    "detailed_description": "Your goal is to successfully reach the planets to make deliveries.<br><br>You need to observe the best way to get to your destination using our card-based movement system to move the spaceship. Wormholes, nebulas and solar storms will not stop you on this journey!<br><br>Travel across the galaxy, admire the wonders of outer space and be careful not to be swallowed by a black hole!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><strong>Choose a card and then a direction to move the spaceship \ud83e\ude90</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/d4c9077e1954c24050c902592e5051fd.poster.avif?t=1752324811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/d4c9077e1954c24050c902592e5051fd.webm?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/d4c9077e1954c24050c902592e5051fd.mp4?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Different types of movement \ud83d\ude80</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/1473e2fe3cf954bf11285ec180d75b01.poster.avif?t=1752324811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/1473e2fe3cf954bf11285ec180d75b01.webm?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/1473e2fe3cf954bf11285ec180d75b01.mp4?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>.....................................<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/2646b969d632e0901c67d1e7b9f5d2de.poster.avif?t=1752324811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/2646b969d632e0901c67d1e7b9f5d2de.webm?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/2646b969d632e0901c67d1e7b9f5d2de.mp4?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Beware of the dangers of space \ud83d\udd73</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/5d49bf1709e1d559fb6219d38e074206.poster.avif?t=1752324811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/5d49bf1709e1d559fb6219d38e074206.webm?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947050/extras/5d49bf1709e1d559fb6219d38e074206.mp4?t=1752324811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features \ud83c\udf0c</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 70 unique levels, with 7 differents planets</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various space obstacles to overcome</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Card-based movement with different choices to move your ship</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A challenge and relaxing experience</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mouse only</li></ul>",
